550 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (To a non-stick, oven-proof pan, add the flour, egg, 3 garlic cloves \(crushed\), and a tsp of dried oregano. Combine the ingredients well until you have a smooth dough. Once you achieve this texture \(you may need to add another bit of flour depending on the yogurt used\), spread and flatten the dough to the desired pizza size.)
/E (To a non-stick, oven-proof pan, add the flour, egg, 3 garlic cloves \(crushed\), and a tsp of dried oregano. Combine the ingredients well until you have a smooth dough. Once you achieve this texture \(you may need to add another bit of flour depending on the yogurt used\), spread and flatten the dough to the desired pizza size.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [2]
